<%- include('header') %>
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECORD MANAGEMENT</span><h1>删除动物档案</h1><p>仅用于管理员处理误录或重复记录。</p></div><a class="button" href="/animals/<%= animal._id %>/adoption">返回领养管理</a></div>
<% if (error) { %><div class="warning-box" role="alert"><p><%= error %></p></div><% } %>
<section class="panel form-panel"><div class="warning-box"><h2>此操作不可撤销</h2><p>将删除这只动物及其全部跟进、领养记录。删除人、时间、动物编号及原因会单独留存。已结案档案不允许删除。</p></div><dl><dt>动物编号</dt><dd><%= animal.animalCode %></dd><dt>外观描述</dt><dd><%= animal.appearance %></dd><dt>发现地点</dt><dd><%= animal.foundLocation %></dd><dt>领养状态</dt><dd><%= labels.adoptionStatuses[animal.adoptionStatus] %></dd></dl>
<form method="POST" action="/animals/<%= animal._id %>/delete" class="spaced"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>删除原因 <em>*</em><textarea name="deletionReason" rows="4" maxlength="1000" required><%= values.deletionReason %></textarea></label><label class="checkbox spaced"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" value="yes" required>我已确认这是误录或重复档案，并同意删除关联记录</label><div class="form-bottom"><a class="button" href="/animals/<%= animal._id %>/adoption">取消</a><button class="primary" type="submit">确认删除档案</button></div></form></section><%- include('footer') %>
